{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/extras/opscam.png?t=1740168054\" /><strong><br><br>OpsCam</strong> is a low-poly team-based multiplayer game. Players engage in fast-paced combat in close-quarters environments. Join other players in electrifying PvP battles. Build your strategy, coordinate with your team to defeat the opposing squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The customization system allows you to adjust your weapon to suit your needs. Modify sights, grips, muzzles, and attachments to achieve the best performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try it out and have fun!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3088080?t=1740168054","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/be6e4b67f71c8fd80f7499838d46e89880a14917/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740168054","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/628ba9a4c587cbdc29192719c8a09e9b426b6bfa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740168054","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/628ba9a4c587cbdc29192719c8a09e9b426b6bfa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740168054","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/extras/opscam.png?t=1740168054\" /><strong><br><br>OpsCam</strong> is a low-poly team-based multiplayer game. Players engage in fast-paced combat in close-quarter